{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y删减了X中少数很有辨识度的细微感受，例如“事情过去了，身体还不信”“安静刚认出就退去”，个别新比喻也稍显用力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"平\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮抓住句眼，话与感受交替呈现，感受又按音乐时点出现，普通观众更容易边听边扫到每段重点。它把舍不得、想起受过的委屈、怀念亲近、害怕孤单到决定不急着回头的心理变化串得更清楚，人物为什么这样想也更容易理解。X保留了更多零散但有价值的细微感受，细节上并非没有优势，不过整体的信息组织和观看体验不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "87fe9c7c-11b7-4316-8a83-1a9ee16ceeea", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031831550683Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:19:17.054098+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1267af9131e16ef64519619da71baa7907fe046c7e6fdc8a7d0540f252e78a0d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed